<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sulejman Vokshi</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1815–1890</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sulejman Vokshi was an Albanian military leader from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gjakova">Gjakova</a> and a commander of the League of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prizren">Prizren</a>, formed in 1878 to resist the transfer of Albanian-inhabited lands to Montenegro and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/serbia">Serbia</a>. He led the League's forces until the Ottoman army suppressed it in 1881.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/sulejman-vokshi.jpg" alt="Sulejman Vokshi" width="320" height="425" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sulejman_Vokshi.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
